# Remaining uses of esp-hal, esp-pacs and the crates that travel with them
# (esp-riscv-rt, esp-metadata, esp-println, esp-backtrace, esp-bootloader-esp-idf,
# esp-sync, esp-rom-sys): `<file> <number of places>`. A place is a Rust path
# that starts at one of those crates, or a dependency on one. Lines are removed
# as the platform moves to our own HAL and PAC; none is added.
Cargo.toml 2
chips/esp32c5/board/Cargo.toml 1
